		<description>The standard issue rifle of the transhuman arm of the Combine Overwatch, the Overwatch Standard Issue Pulse Rifle (OSIPR) is a fearsome weapon that mixes alien technology into a familiar design. The AR1 is an earlier, lighter model that was deployed in more limited quantities than the succeeding AR2.</description>
